"determinant:robot-kinematics":{"type":"application","label":{"zh":"det J = 0 就是奇异","en":"det J = 0 is a singularity"},"reason":{"zh":"Jacobian 把关节速度映射成末端速度，二连杆的 det J = l₁l₂ sinθ₂；两杆共线时 sinθ₂ = 0，矩阵把速度平面压扁成一条线，有一个方向再也动不了。","en":"The Jacobian maps joint speeds to hand velocity, and for two links det J = l₁l₂ sinθ₂; when the links line up sinθ₂ = 0, the matrix squashes the velocity plane onto a line, and one direction of motion is lost."},"source":"../computing/graphics/robot-kinematics/#step2"},
"dual-port-multipath:sata-tunneling-protocol":{"type":"foundation","label":{"zh":"SATA 盘只有一条路","en":"A SATA drive has one path"},"reason":{"zh":"第 7 章说明为什么在第 4 章的模型里 SATA 盘插在双控背板上只算一条路。","en":"Chapter 7 explains why, in chapter 4's model, a SATA drive on a dual-controller backplane counts as one path."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-sas-works/#ch7"},
"exp-log:big-o-notation":{"type":"foundation","label":{"zh":"log n 从对半切来","en":"log n comes from halving"},"reason":{"zh":"n 个元素能对半切约 log₂ n 次，所以分治算法里总冒出 log n；n 从 1000 到 100 万，log₂ n 只从约 10 涨到约 20。","en":"n items can be halved about log₂ n times, which is why log n keeps appearing in divide-and-conquer algorithms; as n goes from a thousand to a million, log₂ n only rises from about 10 to about 20."},"source":"../computing/algorithms/sorting/#step2"},
