"feedback:tcp-congestion-control":{"type":"application","label":{"zh":"发送速率的反馈环","en":"A feedback loop on the sending rate"},"reason":{"zh":"发送端测量确认与丢包、据此调整窗口，再看网络的反应——测量、比较、调整，这就是一条反馈控制回路。","en":"The sender measures acknowledgements and losses, adjusts its window and watches how the network responds — measure, compare, adjust: a feedback control loop."},"source":"../computing/systems/tcp-congestion/#step4"},
"flash-endurance-ecc-tbw:t10-pi-dif":{"type":"application","label":{"zh":"盘内纠错之外的校验","en":"Checks beyond the drive ECC"},"reason":{"zh":"第 8 章把盘内纠错码当作黑箱（见《硬盘里到底是什么》第 5 章），PI 守的是主机到盘片的整条路。","en":"Chapter 8 treats the drive's ECC as a black box (chapter 5 of “What a Drive Is Made Of”); PI guards the whole path from host to platter."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-sas-works/#ch8"},
